('hb-en-001', 'hout-bay-harbour', 'Rachel Green', 'Seattle, USA', 'rachel.g@email.com', 5, 'Charming working harbor with authentic Cape Town character! Loved watching the fishermen bring in their daily catch. The fish market is bustling and fresh. Great spot for fish and chips with stunning mountain backdrop. Perfect blend of culture and scenery!', '2024-08-18', 'en', true, 17, NOW(), NOW()),
('hb-en-002', 'hout-bay-harbour', 'Tom Williams', 'Edinburgh, UK', 'tom.w@email.com', 4, 'Lovely harbor area with great atmosphere. The seal colony boat trips are fantastic - saw hundreds of seals! The craft market has some unique local items. Can get quite busy but thats part of the charm. Great for families.', '2024-08-11', 'en', true, 12, NOW(), NOW()),

